title: CRD spec-drift checker for the CRD providers
updated: 2026-09-02T14:11:31Z
---

Analog to maint/spec-drift-check.pl but for the CRD providers (Cilium, Traefik, K3s, CertManager, GatewayAPI, AgentSandbox). The core tool only diffs the k8s swagger; the providers have no drift check at all. Each provider already declares sub upstream_version. New maint/crd-drift-check.pl fetches each provider upstream CRD manifests at that version, parses openAPIV3Schema, and diffs GVKs + top-level spec fields against the shipped resource_map and class registries. Per-provider crd_sources() hook added to each provider (co-located with upstream_version). Offline fixtures under spec/crd/, maint/crd-drift-exceptions.yaml for deliberate non-gaps. Report-only, never edits lib/. Requested 2026-09-02.
